# Vessel — A Composable Agent Harness

[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](LICENSE)
[![npm](https://img.shields.io/npm/v/composable-agent-harness.svg)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/composable-agent-harness)
![Node](https://img.shields.io/badge/node-%3E%3D20-brightgreen)
![Tests](https://img.shields.io/badge/tests-2237%20%2B%20120%20passed-brightgreen)

> 本地优先 · 模型无关 · 可组合 · 可观察 · 带硬策略边界的 Agent Harness

> **Carry intelligence. Shape behavior. Guard execution.**

Vessel（器）取名自「大器免成 / 无器之器」：**系统本身不是任何一个组件**。Model、Prompt、Agent、工具都只是可替换的"器"；Vessel 是承载这些器、并让它们各自可靠运转的框架——器可以一件件换掉，系统不因此失效。

*English:* Vessel is a local-first, model-agnostic, composable agent harness: a thin core loop, behaviour compiled from a versioned IR, hard policy enforcement instead of prompt-only rules, and a CLI/web surface — every component replaceable without the system failing.

---

## 状态：**可用**（2026-09-18 在当前 HEAD 实测；CI 已绿）

三项门禁都在本仓库当前提交上跑通，命令与结果如下（可自行复跑）：

| 门禁 | 命令 | 实测结果 |
|---|---|---|
| 类型检查 / 构建 | `npm run build`（`tsc -b`） | **exit 0** |
| 测试类型检查（非 composite） | `npm run typecheck:tests` | **exit 0** |
| 全量测试（两个 root） | `npm run test:all` | 根 **178 文件 / 2237 passed + 6 skipped**；`apps/web` **11 文件 / 120 passed** |
| Web 生产构建 | `npm run -w @vessel/web build`（vite） | **exit 0** |
| CLI 冒烟（离线，不发网络） | `npm run vessel -- run --prompt "说一句你好"` | `kind=success`，`steps=1`，走内置 `mock` |

> **GitHub Actions 已绿**：`.github/workflows/ci.yml` 在 Windows + Linux 两个腿跑 build / 测试类型检查 / web 类型检查与构建 / 全量测试 / CLI 冒烟；CodeQL 与 Dependabot 告警当前均为 0。

> **零配置即可跑**：没有任何供应商配置时默认使用内置 `mock` 供应商（离线确定性冒烟）。要接真实模型：`vessel setup`（交互向导）或 `vessel provider add …`。
> **已知边界**（如实标注）：`vessel serve`/`vessel web` 的 Web 界面仍在推进；`benchmarks/reports/release-report.{md,json}` 是历史快照，未随最近改动刷新；进程树沙箱在 Windows 上未接入 job object 时会在遥测里如实报 `degraded`；跨 harness conformance **离线** 25/25，**`--live` 外部 harness 基线未做**（外部 adapter 与已装 CLI 版本脱节，见 `tasks/149`）；**运行 `--live` 会驱动你机器上的其他 agent —— 须逐次显式同意，本仓不自动跑**（`tasks/153`）。

---

## 产品公式

Vessel 是一个可组合、可验证、可替换行为层的 Agent Harness，围绕一条产物公式组织：

```
Model + Behavior + Context + Tools + Policy + Memory + Evaluator + Orchestration + Runtime + Surfaces
```

其中 **Behavior** 是核心抽象：Approach 定义（`configs/behavior.default.yaml`）经 **Behavior Compiler** 编译进每个 Agent 的 stable system；**Policy** 以硬边界执法（Prompt Guidance + Tool Interceptor + Runtime Deny + Audit）；**Surfaces** 面向 CLI 与本地 Web 双表面（Web 在后续里程碑，见下方命令参考）。
import * as fs from 'node:fs';
import { canonicalArgumentsHash, type CanonicalToolInvocation, type ToolCall, type ToolExecutionResult, type ToolSpec } from '@vessel/shared';

type Effect = NonNullable<ToolSpec['effects']>;
interface Intent { kind: 'intent'; key: string; attempt: number; effects: Effect; invocation: CanonicalToolInvocation }
interface Outcome { kind: 'outcome'; key: string; attempt: number; status: 'observed' | 'outcome_unknown' }
type Entry = Intent | Outcome;

/** Durable dispatch boundary. Unknown writes are reconciled by a caller, never replayed.
 * The owning Session supplies its existing single-writer lease for this journal.
 */
export class EffectJournal {
  private readonly entries: Entry[];
  constructor(private readonly file: string) {
    this.entries = [];
    if (!fs.existsSync(file)) return;
    const data = fs.readFileSync(file);
    let offset = 0;
    let repairAt: number | undefined;
    while (offset < data.length) {
      const newline = data.indexOf(10, offset);
      const end = newline === -1 ? data.length : newline;
      const line = data.subarray(offset, end).toString('utf8');
      if (line.trim()) {
        try { this.entries.push(JSON.parse(line) as Entry); }
        catch (error) {
          // Only an unterminated tail can be a torn append. Interior corruption
          // must fail closed rather than silently dropping durable effect history.
          if (newline !== -1 || !(error instanceof SyntaxError)) throw error;
          repairAt = offset;
          break;
        }
      }
      offset = end + 1;
    }
    if (repairAt !== undefined || (data.length > 0 && data[data.length - 1] !== 10)) {
      const fd = fs.openSync(file, 'r+');
      try {
        if (repairAt !== undefined) fs.ftruncateSync(fd, repairAt);
        else fs.writeSync(fd, '\n', data.length);
        fs.fsyncSync(fd);
      } finally { fs.closeSync(fd); }
    }
  }
  private append(entry: Entry): void {
    const fd = fs.openSync(this.file, 'a');
    try { fs.writeSync(fd, JSON.stringify(entry) + '\n'); fs.fsyncSync(fd); } finally { fs.closeSync(fd); }
    this.entries.push(entry);
  }
  pending(): Intent[] {
    return this.entries.filter((entry): entry is Intent => entry.kind === 'intent' && !this.entries.some(outcome => outcome.kind === 'outcome' && outcome.key === entry.key && outcome.attempt === entry.attempt && outcome.status === 'observed'));
  }
  begin(call: ToolCall, tool: ToolSpec, invocation: CanonicalToolInvocation, key = call.toolCallId): void {
    const previous = this.entries.filter((entry): entry is Intent => entry.kind === 'intent' && entry.key === key).at(-1);
    const effects = tool.effects ?? (tool.requiredPermission === 'read' ? 'read_only' : 'non_idempotent');
    if (!previous && effects !== 'read_only' && this.pending().some(intent => intent.effects !== 'read_only')) {
      throw new Error('OUTCOME_UNKNOWN: pending session effect requires reconciliation before further writes');
    }
    if (previous) {
      if (previous.effects !== effects) throw new Error('Effect classification changed during recovery');
      if (canonicalArgumentsHash(previous.invocation) !== canonicalArgumentsHash(invocation)) throw new Error('Invocation identity changed during recovery');
      const complete = this.entries.some(entry => entry.kind === 'outcome' && entry.key === key && entry.attempt === previous.attempt && entry.status === 'observed');
      if (complete || effects !== 'read_only') throw new Error(complete ? 'Invocation already observed; replay prohibited' : 'OUTCOME_UNKNOWN: effect reconciliation required');
    }
    this.append({ kind: 'intent', key, attempt: (previous?.attempt ?? 0) + 1, effects, invocation });

